{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cbbf","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c765-6a15-7930-81af-9d81d9b3108a"},"sequence":1082,"recorded_at":1780531400002159,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"eb24712a-98eb-41ba-85bf-fe73b2577481","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"eb24712a-98eb-41ba-85bf-fe73b2577481","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"eb24712a-98eb-41ba-85bf-fe73b2577481"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c76a-ffcb-7b73-990c-e055e6934bd8"},"task_id":"01a0c76a-ffcb-7b73-990c-e055e6934bd8","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c76a-ffcb-7b73-990c-e055e6934bd8","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-44-1\",\n  \"command\": \"sed -n '2590,2680p' /Users/iv/.agents/skills/project-management/references/tracked-background-spawn.md\",\n  \"description\": \"Read refresh-candidate skill documentation\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"\\n### Safety checklist before unsafe mode\\n\\n1. Confirm working directory is correct (`pwd`, `-C` path).\\n2. Ensure prompt has no destructive commands (`rm -rf`, broad `git reset`, etc.).\\n3. Limit scope to one task and one repo.\\n4. Log output to file for auditability.\\n5. Prefer explicit tracked spawn (`--role`, `--background`, `--model`, and Codex/Qwen/Claude `--reasoning-effort` when applicable); use manual launch only as a fallback.\\n\\n### Permission/trust error map\\n\\n- `Not inside a trusted directory and --skip-git-repo-check was not specified`\\n  - Fix: add repo to `~/.codex/config.toml` trust list or run with `--skip-git-repo-check`.\\n\\n- `SandboxDenied` / operation not permitted for filesystem or process commands\\n  - Fix: keep work in workspace, or rerun with unsafe mode if strictly needed.\\n\\n- Stream disconnects to `chatgpt.com/backend-api/codex/responses` in restricted environments\\n  - Fix: rerun outside restrictive sandbox/network path; verify account/model availability.\\n\\n### Explicit recovery of a dirty final-leaf base\\n\\nUse `task-board worktree refresh-candidate ELEMENT` from the matching live tracked\\nproducer after combining current protected trunk into the uncommitted candidate.\\nThis preserves candidate files exactly, so it cannot substitute for that source\\nintegration or its tests. It requires exclusive Story ownership, a current rework\\nrevision and no other pending revision. Staged changes refuse. Checkpoint replay\\nruns signed in isolation; branch/index application and metadata reconciliation\\nare bound by a durable intent, retained across provisioning and retried by the\\nsame command. Conflicts, changed authority, candidate drift and foreign ownership\\nrefuse with the candidate preserved. Publish and independently review a new CR\\nbefore any integration. This explicit route does not change automatic dirty\\nworkspace skipping or authorize reuse of stale acceptance.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1896,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 474,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
