refuses unknown ones, the exec adapter reconstructs the exact\\n+`tmux -S <socket> <subcommand>` vector per operation and refuses\\n+forged binaries, flag injection, and ambient socket discovery, and\\n+the probed socket generation is bound (B18-B20) before any execution.\\n+Bodies are pure argv builders whose stable pane entrypoint stays\\n+`ax pane SESSION_ID`; effects run through the landed terminstance\\n+engine with strict per-operation deadlines, generation rechecks, and\\n+AX-side state memory for reconciliation, while attach, terminate, and\\n+restore mirror the landed backend, fencing, and axpane gates. Quiesce\\n+cuts operator input by locking then detaching every attached client\\n+and refusing new input-authorized attaches at the entry (read-only\\n+observation stays); the boundary waits blocking for the wrapper\\n+signal with the proof kind bound into its evidence; probes prove\\n+absence only from marked tmux stderr and read every other failure as\\n+unknown. Every mutating operation replays the identical request\\n+idempotently; uncertain receipts reconcile through status before\\n+resuming.\\n \\n Run the focused tests and coverage with:\\n \\n@@ -2370,7 +2390,7 @@ go test ./internal/tmuxserver -count=1\\n go test ./internal/tmuxserver -cover -count=1\\n ```\\n \\n-Run the narrowing battery (73 narrowing mutants, two supplementary\\n+Run the narrowing battery (207 narrowing mutants, two supplementary\\n additive rows, plus one harmless control) with:\\n \\n ```bash\\n@@ -2382,7 +2402,9 @@ through the production entry point, restores the file from backup, and\\n reports per-row verdicts with subprocess exits; `AX_MUTANT_VERBOSE=1`\\n additionally prints the raw per-plant logs, and `--log-dir` captures one\\n raw log per plant. Task validation logs and mutation artifacts are\\n-attached to `TASK-260830-35urbp`. The package adds no `ax` command, no\\n+attached to `TASK-260830-35urbp`, with the lifecycle battery and its\\n+raw per-plant logs attached to `TASK-260830-1c28dz`. The package adds\\n+no `ax` command, no\\n `doctor` result, and no runtime capability claim; the clause-to-test\\n matrix with its stated bounds lives in\\n [the task evidence map](internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md).\\n=== HEAD README tmuxserver anchors ===\\n2365:## Private tmux server management (`tmuxserver` leaf)\\n2367:[`internal/tmuxserver`](internal/tmuxserver) creates owner-only runtime\\n2405:go test ./internal/tmuxserver -count=1\\n2406:go test ./internal/tmuxserver -cover -count=1\\n2413:PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/tmuxserver/mutant_harness.py\\n2424:[the task evidence map](internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md).\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 3319,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 830,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
