ths error and prove nothing; `classifyAbsence` proves absence only from exit + stderr marker (tmux 3.6a verified), everything else unknown at all three consumers (probe/poll/terminate). Bound B35: other tmux versions fail closed.\\n- P1-D: custody walks the lexical path with per-prefix no-follow opens (no `EvalSymlinks`); root handle bound via `os.SameFile`.\\n- P1-E: create persists the binding doc; restore re-admits it through `termbind.ParseTerminalBinding` with agreement checks and returns it; after-restore branch (local lease → bounded 5000 ms refresh → resume/offer/park) wired and measured.\\n- P2-A: outcomes (with original timestamps) persisted per idempotency key and replayed; crash/retry paths attacked. Bound B34: receipt/outcome crash window re-observes time.\\n- P2-B: custody entry cells reclassified U2a → M with the reviewer's four exact shapes; symmetry paragraph carries per-side counts; ratio restated 208/4448 measured, 34 bound, 4206 unreachable; OUTCOME-keyed importer comparison over the 34-package closure: 2662 top-level + 20345 subtest shared inputs, zero moved, 205+169 additions all PASS in tmuxserver, zero removed.\\n- VALIDATION (exit 0, this run): gofmt/build/vet; full suite 45 ok (3083 top-level PASS in -v); race 45 ok no data races; cover (tmuxserver 87.4%); 17 fuzz gates; tracecheck; cataloggen -adopted -check; linux+windows builds; windows vet; JSON check; board validate (0 referencing this task); diff check; no-tmux proof (tmux hidden, 604 PASS); harness 210/210 (209 KILLED incl. 2 additive, 1 harmless control SURVIVED); 162/162 run masks match live tests.\\n- STATUS: ready for review; worktree intentionally UNCOMMITTED for Story handoff snapshot. Results standalone + matrix + `TASK-260830-1c28dz_rework-evidence-rev2.tar.gz` attached to the board item.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2789,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 698,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
