winner, without a foldable lifecycle, or when the\n89|\t// outcome is neither parked nor a remote offer. A park without\n90|\t// chain authority parks without evidence, never by manufacturing\n91|\t// a sequence collision under another host's lease.\n92|\tEvent     *sessrepo.EventRef\n93|\tEventJSON []byte\n94|\tEmitted   bool\n95|}\n96|\n97|// Run orchestrates the wrapper: validate configuration, load the\n98|// logical session, derive the fold's newest checkpoint, prove the\n99|// bootstrap binding state, observe the winning lease, load\n100|// materialization, checkpoint, and profile state, decide through\n101|// the pure core, then apply exactly the authorized durable\n102|// effect. A store failure propagates as an error with no decision:\n103|// unknown is never absence and never a launch.\n104|func Run(stores Stores, request Request) (Outcome, error) {\n105|\tempty := Outcome{}\n106|\tif stores.Repo == nil || stores.Pane == nil {\n107|\t\treturn empty, fmt.Errorf(\"axpane run carries no repository or binding store\")\n108|\t}\n109|\t// The request hooks arm a copy of the binding handle: Run never\n110|\t// mutates the caller's store.\n111|\tpane := *stores.Pane\n112|\tpaneStore := pane.WithHooks(request.Hooks)\n113|\tinput := Input{\n114|\t\tSessionID:               request.SessionID,\n115|\t\tBootstrapOperationID:    request.BootstrapOperationID,\n116|\t\tMode:                    request.Mode,\n117|\t\tPresented:               request.Presented,\n118|\t\tProvider:                request.Provider,\n119|\t\tSmoke:                   request.Smoke,\n120|\t\tRealm:                   request.Realm,\n121|\t\tBackend:                 request.Backend,\n122|\t\tEntrypoint:              request.Entrypoint,\n123|\t\tHostBinding:             request.HostBinding,\n124|\t\tRemoteInteractive:       request.RemoteInteractive,\n125|\t\tInteractive:             request.Interactive,\n126|\t\tCheckpointRequired:      request.CheckpointRequired,\n127|\t\tCheckpointID:            