d directly, UNT = unexported internals called\n323|directly in unit tests (body parsers, rowError, providerTriple,\n324|cutRow, ReconcileAdmission). Cell codes M/U1/U2/U3/B as above, with\n325|U2 reasons tagged: U2a = entry never calls this code; U2b = entry\n326|tests carry post-gate values only (the narrowed direction is measured\n327|at the listed entry); U2c = reachable only through caller-injected\n328|Production Dependencies with no committed composition test (bound\n329|B27).\n330|\n331|Table B: old gates × new entries (24 × 21 = 504 cells; 10 M, 494\n332|U2a). Only the verify side (via custody delegation) and the server\n333|attestation (via attach) are reachable from new entries; every other\n334|old gate reads U2a throughout because no new code calls it (new code\n335|never ensures, never lexically gates, never reads ambient, never\n336|remaps, never consults creation, and never calls BuildArgv,\n337|CheckBrokerContact, or the Acquire call sites).\n338|\n339|| Gate (site) | EXC | EXA | EXS | EXE | EXT | EXR | PRB | SPW | DIAL | CMD | DIRV | PDIR | LEN | CUS | REC | LOOK | CLS | OBSP | PFX | OSR | UNT |\n340||---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n341|| caller (acquire.go:149) | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a |\n342|| details (acquire.go:152) | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a |\n343|| render (acquire.go:289) | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a |\n344|| dispatch (acquire.go:163) | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a |\n345|| plat (runtime.go:76) | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a | U2a 