{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000fe69","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c765-6a15-7930-81af-9d81d9b3108a"},"sequence":7567,"recorded_at":1780531400015129,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"eb24712a-98eb-41ba-85bf-fe73b2577481","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"eb24712a-98eb-41ba-85bf-fe73b2577481","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"eb24712a-98eb-41ba-85bf-fe73b2577481"},"call_id":"call_01a0c7b29b487599a812db3f253faf5f","text":"Read text file `internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md`.\n(299 line(s) above)\n300|| server (readiness.go:40) | M running tests ×4 / N-realm-membership + N-realm-generation + N-unattested-foreground (both-empty U3: details gate precedes) | M miss-table server subtests ×5 + catalog-decoy table / N-realm-membership + N-realm-generation + N-broker-zero-admission (admitted-without-gen test-pinned, R10 anchor shared — replay-verified; the 15 catalog decoys are test-pinned, row N-realm-membership keeps its headless_creation member) | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | M broker-contact server subtests ×5 / N-realm-membership + N-realm-generation (both-empty server pair U3: principal arm precedes) | M TestCheckServerAttestedRefusesEachMissingConjunct ×6 + catalog-decoy table / N-realm-membership + N-realm-generation + N-realm-empty-want | U2 |\n301|| running (acquire.go:236) | M running tests + probe-failure / N-running-empty-admission + N-running-empty-generation + N-unattested-foreground | U2 background decides the broker report, never a Running flag | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 BRO/SRV decide admissions without a Running flag | U2 | U2 |\n302|| probe (acquire.go:190,232) | M TestAcquireForegroundProbeFailurePassesThrough / N-probe-swallow-foreground | M TestAcquireBackgroundProbeFailurePassesThrough / N-probe-swallow-background | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 |\n303|| spawn (acquire.go:246) | M TestAcquireForegroundSpawnFailureReportsWithoutFallback + TestAcquireForegroundSpawnIsIdempotentAcrossRetry / N-spawn-swallow | U2 no spawn call on the background path (structural); no-fallback proof is the spy census + D rows at creation × ABG | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 |\n304|| argv (argv.go:17,24) | M TestAcquireForegroundSpawnsDedicatedServer full element compare / N-argv-detached + N-argv-tail (socket/session arms U3: socket always derived, session pre-validated; CheckArgv shape arm B12: unreachable through Acquire) | U2 background never builds spawn argv | U2 | U2 | M exact-vector + ambient-socket + invalid-shape + malformed-session tests / N-argv-socket + N-argv-tmuxenv + N-argv-shape + N-argv-session + N-argv-detached + N-argv-tail | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 | U2 |\n305|\n306|SOCK (SocketPath) is a pure join and OBS (ObserveAmbient) records\n307|without deciding: neither enforces any gate, so their columns read U\n308|throughout by construction — the wiring gate pins what callers pass\n309|to the join. CRE decides only G-creation; every other CRE cell is U\n310|because the direct entry answers only \"may this caller create\" for\n311|post-gate caller values.\n312|\n313|## Second-leaf census\n314|\n315|New columns: EXC/EXA/EXS/EXE/EXT/EXR = Execute create, attach,\n316|status, engine ops (quiesce/boundary/stop), terminate-stale, restore;\n317|PRB = ServerProber.Probe, SPW = ServerSpawner.Spawn, DIAL =\n318|UnixDialer.Dial, CMD = BuildCommand, DIRV = DirectivesFor, PDIR =\n319|ParseDirective, LEN = CheckSocketLength, CUS = CheckSocketCustody,\n320|REC/LOOK = InstanceStates Record/Lookup (including the RecordOutcome/RecordBindingDoc writes and the LookupOutcome/LookupBindingDoc reads), CLS = ClassifyStatus, OBSP =\n321|ObserveStatus called directly, PFX = PerformEffect called directly,\n322|OSR = OSRunner called directly, UNT = unexported internals called\n323|directly in unit tests (body parsers, rowError, providerTriple,\n324|cutRow, ReconcileAdmission). Cell codes M