{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000fecb","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c765-6a15-7930-81af-9d81d9b3108a"},"sequence":7616,"recorded_at":1780531400015227,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"eb24712a-98eb-41ba-85bf-fe73b2577481","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"eb24712a-98eb-41ba-85bf-fe73b2577481","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"eb24712a-98eb-41ba-85bf-fe73b2577481"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c7b2-b81f-7ed0-8021-02cc33f6c82b"},"task_id":"01a0c7b2-b81f-7ed0-8021-02cc33f6c82b","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c7b2-b81f-7ed0-8021-02cc33f6c82b","chunk":"Read text file `internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md`.\n(663 line(s) above)\n664|- B21 No broker is modelled as the zero BrokerReport, whose\n665|  Principal.UID is 0: for a non-root process the absent broker\n666|  refuses on the authentication arm, while under a root process the\n667|  same-user arm passes and refusal comes from the generation arm.\n668|  The broker-path outcome socket binding is the generation equality\n669|  only — BrokerReport carries no socket of its own.\n670|- B22 Singleton arms ship no narrowing mutant: admitting the\n671|  singleton refused member is deleting the gate. Covered sites, each\n672|  test-pinned in both directions where a fork exists: create relay\n673|  transport (relay), descriptor presence fork (descpresence),\n674|  attach admission nil (serveadmitnil), spawner runner nil\n675|  (spawnnil), reconcile verifier nil (reconcilenil), states root\n676|  empty (stateopen), persist/attach stores nil (storenil),\n677|  failed-kill self-confirm (selfconfirm), live-after-escalation\n678|  (stoptimeout), outcome-lookup empty key (outcomekey LOOK side;\n679|  the record side narrows over its operation member). Owner: this\n680|  leaf; retest if any site grows a second refused member.\n681|- B23 The landed status engine normalizes backend error details to\n682|  \"status observation unknown\" (coded or not), so the cutrow and\n683|  empty-panes narrowings measure at the helper entries while the\n684|  dispatch legs pin the code. Owner: this leaf; retest if the\n685|  engine stops normalizing.\n686|- B24 The idempotency-store Completed read-failure arm is unstaged:\n687|  no seam fails receipt reads (hooks fire on write paths only).\n688|  Owner: hardening; stage with a read-failure seam to measure.\n689|- B25 The Bind clean-miss sub-arm is unstageable: every Bind error\n690|  the hooks stage leaves the committed file, so Lookup always finds\n691|  it. The clean-found sub-arm is measured (N-bind-hook-found).\n692|  Owner: hardening.\n693|- B26 The attach effect-failure dispatch mapping is unstaged: no\n694|  committed failure reaches it (the store replays identical\n695|  receipts; conflicting receipts are untested at dispatch).\n696|  Owner: hardening.\n697|- B27 No committed test composes the Production Dependencies into\n698|  Acquire: AFG reaches the adapter and bind gates only through\n699|  caller-injected implementations (the 19 Table C U2c cells). The\n700|  injection seam is first-leaf-owned; Production wiring is\n701|  unit-pinned (TestProductionWiresDependencies). Owner: composition\n702|  test, sibling scope.\n703|- B28 The backend command-error wrap is unmeasured at PFX (no\n704|  backend test stages a refused build; the builder rows pin the\n705|  refused shapes at CMD). Owner: this leaf; retest with a\n706|  refused-build backend test.\n707|- B29 The close-confirm poll deadline is pinned for past-deadline\n708|  at PFX via direct staging; the exact-boundary member and\n709|  dispatch-level staging are unmeasured (the fake runner advances\n710|  no time). Owner: hardening.\n711|- B30 The OSRunner exit/transport/argv mappings are total functions\n712|  over uncoded inputs with no refused class to admit a member of;\n713|  tests pin them including real-exec scrub, stderr-capture, and\n714|  signal-death integrations. The signal-death arm (a killed child\n715|  errors instead of reporting -1 data) is a refused class and\n716|  carries its own narrowing row; the remaining mappings stay total.\n717|  Owner: this leaf.\n718|- B31 The custody root-ownership arm is untested and singleton: the\n719|  ownership seam stages leaf-first (the leaf refuses before the\n720|  root arm runs), and a truly foreign root needs privilege. Owner:\n721|  hardening with a privileged stage or a root-level seam.\n722|- B32 The leaf-delegation wiring is measured at CUS (wrong-leaf\n723|  mutants are observable only on compliant roots); the absence\n724|  propagation through the six dispatch paths, the prober, and the\n725|  spawner is pinned by absence tests without a row. Owner: this\n726|  leaf.\n727|- B33 The wrapper safe-boundary signal step is unimplemented in the\n728|  landed wrapper: the boundary entry waits blocking on\n729|  `ax-boundary-<generation>` for the wrapper's `wait-for -S`, and\n730|  the wrapper never signals today, so boundary waits time out with\n731|  the coded quiesce_timeout (fail closed, never a faked proof)\n732|  until the signal step lands. The wait vector, the proof-kind\n733|  binding, the provider-row context, and the timeout are this\n734|  leaf's and fully driven; the signal emission is the wrapper's.\n735|  Owner: the wrapper (`ax pane`) task; retest the full\n736|  quiesce-boundary-stop flow when the signal lands.\n737|- B34 A crash between the mutation-receipt commit and the operation\n738|  outcome record re-observes the report time on retry: the effect\n739|  never re-runs and the evidence never changes, but the reported\n740|  closure/boundary time renders from the retry clock instead of\n741|  the original one. Sequential retries without a crash replay\n742|  identical times. Owner: this leaf; closing the window needs the\n743|  outcome inside the engine-owned receipt.\n744|- B35 The absence stderr markers are verified against tmux 3.6a\n745|  (`can't find session`, `can't find window`, and the\n746|  no-such-socket connect error); any other version's\n747|  absence-shaped stderr fails closed to unknown. Owner: this leaf;\n748|  re-verify the marker set when the tmux floor version moves.\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
