{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-000000010513","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c765-6a15-7930-81af-9d81d9b3108a"},"sequence":8420,"recorded_at":1780531400016835,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"eb24712a-98eb-41ba-85bf-fe73b2577481","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"eb24712a-98eb-41ba-85bf-fe73b2577481","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"eb24712a-98eb-41ba-85bf-fe73b2577481"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c7b6-124e-7912-a595-67b60d09f7e6"},"task_id":"01a0c7b6-124e-7912-a595-67b60d09f7e6","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c7b6-124e-7912-a595-67b60d09f7e6","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 548-554\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-Ratio: 208 measured of 4448 (50+10+148 M across Tables A/B/D;\n-Table C all U); 34 bound; 4206 unreachable with reasons. Every\n-driven refusal direction is measured except the bound cells: 22\n-driven but rowless (B22 singletons/forks, B23 normalized details,\n-B29 poll past-deadline, B32 propagation) and 8 named undriven gaps\n-(B24/B25/B26/B28/B31 cells, B29 dispatch side), each with its owner\n-below.\n+Ratio: 227 measured of 5576 (50+10+167 M across Tables A/B/D;\n+Table C all U); 156 bound; 4193 unreachable with reasons. Every\n+driven refusal direction is measured except the bound cells: 27\n+driven but rowless (B22 singletons/forks, B23 normalized details,\n+B29 poll past-deadline, B32 propagation, B36 singleton deps) and\n+125 named undriven gaps (B24/B25/B26/B28/B31 cells, B29 dispatch\n+side, and the 117 B39 reachable-undriven cells), each with its\n+owner below. (Table A's 4 B15 guard-name arms are bound outside\n+this split.)\n+\n+Table E: after-restore outcome grid (ExecuteWrapperRestore,\n+wrapper.go:97). Each row is one decided outcome with its evidence\n+condition, its backend effect, and the committed test plus the\n+narrowing row that kills a routing/order mutant through the\n+wrapper entry (test names drop the Test prefix):\n+\n+| Outcome | Evidence condition | Backend effect | Test / row |\n+|---|---|---|---|\n+| launch | verified local win + valid materialization | executes backend restore exactly once | LocalWinResumes; reorder covered by N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n+| reattach | verified local win + recorded bootstrap pair | executes backend restore exactly once | ReattachReplaysBackend; reorder covered by N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n+| attach_remote | refreshed remote winner + lapsed local grant + interactive | none (no backend op, no exec, no provider) | LapsedGrantRemoteOffer/attach; N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n+| takeover_offer | refreshed remote winner + lapsed local grant + non-capable attach | none (no backend op, no exec, no provider) | LapsedGrantRemoteOffer/takeover; N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n+| parked (remote-noninteractive) | refreshed remote winner + non-interactive terminal | none | ParksWithoutEffects/remote-noninteractive; N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n+| parked (refresh-failed) | refresh error → unverified local knowledge | none | ParksWithoutEffects/refresh-failed; N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n+| parked (no-adapter) | missing refresh adapter → unverified local knowledge | none | ParksWithoutEffects/no-adapter; N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n+| parked (no-known-lease) | no lease known at all → zero winner | none | ParksWithoutEffects/no-known-lease; N-wrapper-reorder-refresh |\n+| parked (invalid-material) | required materialization not admitted | none (routing mutant would execute) | ParksWithoutEffects/invalid-material; N-wrapper-route-material |\n+| parked (refresh-timeout) | refresh blocks → cancelled at the bound, unverified | none | RefreshBoundMeasured/configured-50ms; N-refresh-bound-default (default leg) |\n+| refuse (mode) | Decide.Mode != restore (incl. garbage) | none, invalid-arguments | RefusesMalformed; N-wrapper-mode |\n+| refuse (operation) | Restore.Operation != restore (incl. garbage) | none, invalid-arguments | RefusesMalformed; N-wrapper-operation |\n+| refuse (deps) | nil lifecycle or nil dependency | none, protocol-error | RefusesMalformed; B36 singleton (no narrowing row) |\n+\n+The refresh runs before the decision on every row (N-wrapper-\n+reorder-refresh admits exactly the fixture session past the\n+refresh-success arm into stale local knowledge and is killed by\n+the offer/resume/park tests together), so the offer path never\n+presents the lapsed grant to backend restore authorization.\n+Union-rival ambiguity is unmodeled (B38). The parked wire result\n+of the backend restore entry itself (RestoredParked) stays a\n+backend-row concern, not a Table E row.\n","final_result":true}}}
