 += 1\\n    print(name, 'rows=', len(rows), 'cells=', len(rows)*ncols, dict(c))\\n\\\"\",\n  \"description\": \"Verify census consistency\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"=== stale census refs ===\\n326:U2b, reachable-but-undriven, is bound B39 now: those cells state\\n810:  unreachable as U2b; stated as a bound now. Owner: this leaf;\\n=== symbol alive? ===\\n=== recount ===\\nA rows= 24 cells= 264 {'M': 50, 'U': 210, 'B': 4}\\nB rows= 24 cells= 504 {'U': 494, 'M': 10}\\nD rows= 119 cells= 2499 {'B': 152, 'U': 2180, 'M': 167}\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 348,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 87,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
