{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-000000010677","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c765-6a15-7930-81af-9d81d9b3108a"},"sequence":8598,"recorded_at":1780531400017191,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"eb24712a-98eb-41ba-85bf-fe73b2577481","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"eb24712a-98eb-41ba-85bf-fe73b2577481","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"eb24712a-98eb-41ba-85bf-fe73b2577481"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c7b6-9637-7012-9cb2-adeebfc843cd"},"task_id":"01a0c7b6-9637-7012-9cb2-adeebfc843cd","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c7b6-9637-7012-9cb2-adeebfc843cd","chunk":"Read text file `internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md`.\n(210 line(s) above)\n211|## Mutation battery\n212|\n213|`PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/tmuxserver/mutant_harness.py`:\n214|73 narrowing rows KILLED, 2 supplementary additive rows KILLED\n215|(D-background-fallback and D-background-fallback-foreground, labeled),\n216|1 harmless control SURVIVED, on two full passes with identical verdicts\n217|and one raw log per plant per run. Row N-deps-foreground kills by\n218|panic: the admitted request calls the nil spawner and the panic fails\n219|the test. Rows N-verify-absence-detail (background leg),\n220|N-broker-empty-generation, and N-commit-eacces-as-exist kill by reroute\n221|to a neighboring refusal, disclosed in their row notes.\n222|N-absence-remap-widen kills through the top-level custody oracle:\n223|under the errors.As helper the row survives (the reviewer's R05),\n224|under the top-level assertion it kills. N-details-constructor kills by\n225|typed-nil: the swallowed constructor failure returns a typed-nil\n226|*axerror.Error inside a non-nil error interface where the test expects\n227|the invalid-arguments refusal, and the top-level type assertion\n228|reddens. N-session-entry kills\n229|through the no-directory/no-probe assertions while the refusal code\n230|stays correct (the spawn-site arm still refuses the admitted member).\n231|No token-preserving source-text mutant applies: no gate inspects source\n232|text, and the harness executes the behavioral suite (bound B4). The\n233|reviewers' error-arm plants (stat-failure arms flipped to fail-open,\n234|the unreachable guard arm, the unopenable-root arm) are reported as\n235|error-arm rows under bound B15, never counted among the narrowing\n236|rows.\n237|\n238|Second leaf: 134 narrowing rows KILLED, 1 harmless control SURVIVED\n239|(shared), on the full pass with one raw log per plant. Rows\n240|N-lifecycle-entry-deadline-terminate and -restore kill by the no-bind\n241|assertion (the loop recheck would refuse the same verdict); row\n242|N-entry-generation patches two sites and kills through both subtests,\n243|attribution verified per subtest from the raw log. Rows\n244|N-bind-mismatch-map, N-replay-corrupt-image, N-stop-escalation-kill,\n245|N-bodies-entrypoint-string, and N-bind-hook-found kill by reroute to\n246|a neighboring verdict, disclosed in their row notes. Multi-entry rows\n247|(cmdvector-attach, vector-detached, the status contradiction rows,\n248|directive-unknown, both scrub rows, length-boundary, present-stopped,\n249|boundary-timeout, verify-absence-detail, boundary-blocking,\n250|readonly-vector, quiesce-detach, unmarked-exit, alias-skip,\n251|boundexit) kill through every claimed entry, attribution verified\n252|per test from the raw logs. The four custody-entry rows share one\n253|killer test but kill through one subtest each (single-entry rows).\n254|Singleton refusal arms (relay transport, nil guards,\n255|stop-timeout, failed-kill self-confirm, outcome-lookup empty key)\n256|ship no row: admitting the singleton is deleting the gate (bound\n257|B22). The engine normalizes backend status error details, so the\n258|cutrow and empty-panes narrowings measure at the helper while the\n259|dispatch legs pin the code (bound B23).\n260|\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
