ond refused member.\n350|- B23 The landed status engine normalizes backend error details to\n351|  \"status observation unknown\" (coded or not), so the cutrow and\n352|  empty-panes narrowings measure at the helper entries while the\n353|  dispatch legs pin the code. Owner: this leaf; retest if the\n354|  engine stops normalizing.\n355|- B24 The idempotency-store Completed read-failure arm is unstaged:\n356|  no seam fails receipt reads (hooks fire on write paths only).\n357|  Owner: hardening; stage with a read-failure seam to measure.\n358|- B25 The Bind clean-miss sub-arm is unstageable: every Bind error\n359|  the hooks stage leaves the committed file, so Lookup always finds\n360|  it. The clean-found sub-arm is measured (N-bind-hook-found).\n361|  Owner: hardening.\n362|- B26 The attach effect-failure dispatch mapping is unstaged: no\n363|  committed failure reaches it (the store replays identical\n364|  receipts; conflicting receipts are untested at dispatch).\n365|  Owner: hardening.\n366|- B27 No committed test composes the Production Dependencies into\n367|  Acquire: AFG reaches the adapter and bind gates only through\n368|  caller-injected implementations (the 19 Table C U2c cells). The\n369|  injection seam is first-leaf-owned; Production wiring is\n370|  unit-pinned (TestProductionWiresDependencies). Owner: composition\n371|  test, sibling scope.\n372|- B28 The backend command-error wrap is unmeasured at PFX (no\n373|  backend test stages a refused build; the builder rows pin the\n374|  refused shapes at CMD). Owner: this leaf; retest with a\n375|  refused-build backend test.\n376|- B29 The close-confirm poll deadline is pinned for past-deadline\n377|  at PFX via direct staging; the exact-boundary member and\n378|  dispatch-level staging are unmeasured (the fake runner advances\n379|  no time). Owner: hardening.\n380|- B30 The OSRunner exit/transport/argv mappings are total functions\n381|  over uncoded inputs with no refused class to admit a member of;